 rt
DESCRIPTION:In the week ending November 21\, the advance figure for season
 ally adjusted initial claims was 189\,000\, a decrease of 13\,000 from the
  previous week's revised level. The previous week's level was revised down
  by 1\,000 from 203\,000 to 202\,000. The 4-week moving average was 196\,0
 00\, a decrease of 1\,500 from the previous week's revised average. The pr
 evious week's average was revised down by 250 from 197\,750 to 197\,500.\n
 http://www.dol.gov/newsroom/releases/eta/eta20261125
